quickly cured a major business mess at the first industrial=20
company I controlled, Dempster Mill Manufacturing (one of my=20
"bargain" purchases) and who 24 years later had reappeared to=20
again rescue me, this time from problems at K&amp;W Products, a small=20
Berkshire subsidiary that produces automotive compounds. As I=20
reported, in short order Harry reduced capital employed at K&amp;W,=20
rationalized production, cut costs, and quadrupled profits. You=20
might think he would then have paused for breath. But last year=20
